      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LIQUIDATOR (1) finished third last start over 1780m at Northam, beaten 5 metres, after also filling a minor placing at the previous appearance over 1730m at Central Wheatbelt. Will enjoy a nice run from this favourable starting position. Meets a comparable field and she is capable of another bold performance. ELLEOFAREACTOR (7) led last time out and saluted in a far better performance at Gloucester Park over 1730m, getting home by 8 metres. May need luck at some stage extracting from the inside of the second row. This doesn't look as hard so she is set to continue her resurgent form. IDEAL WHITBY (3) has been thereabouts of late and is a great chance to break through. Good effort last time out when he finished fourth at Gloucester Park over 1730m. HUGHEY (6) is in the mix following a respectable third at his most recent appearance over 2190m at Northam.",
